digraph package_diagram {
  // 138 internal module(s), 53 external root(s), 298 edge(s) drawn
  // 386 import reference(s) considered = 301 drawn + 0 with no module name + 85 path-relative JS/TS this resolver declined + 0 path-relative in a language with no resolver here + 0 whose target is not a node of this graph + 0 naming their own module + 0 with no file
  // nodes: 138 of 138 internal state the file they stand for = 0 in tooltip (a .py this diagram's oracle re-parses) + 138 whose file the oracle confirms EXISTS but whose name it cannot re-derive (nothing here parses that language) + 0 that name more than one file and declare none; the 53 external node(s) are not files of this tree
